{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":15850,\"title\":\"The Trip\",\"tagline\":\"The things we do for love and things we should have done\",\"overview\":\"When 19-year-old gay-rights activist Tommy and 24-year-old Alan first meet in 1973, they find themselves on the opposite sides of the political coin...\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9eaNr0CYiEaofbw5MF5Nsr2MnOI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/soFSQhZQL7eawOuRWDtV8tBSfUj.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"voteCount\":48,\"year\":2002,\"runtime\":95,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":306567,\"director\":\"Miles Swain\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":146811,\"name\":\"Miles Swain\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":117087,\"name\":\"Larry Sullivan\",\"character\":\"Alan Oakley\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oNYTlrHyNEF9Ls2BnwQ0cKSWpUJ.jpg\"},{\"id\":10867,\"name\":\"Steve Braun\",\"character\":\"Tommy Ballenger\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gSUxpCsSpjjTEWbNGCnxGhNKVw7.jpg\"},{\"id\":10190,\"name\":\"Jill St. John\",\"character\":\"Mary Oakley\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o0LKSONTaFmjuf9ntKa4oVbOLKq.jpg\"},{\"id\":12889,\"name\":\"Ray Baker\",\"character\":\"Peter Baxter\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6DIBcIzCCTMxR1RdMbyItg0J6YW.jpg\"},{\"id\":48163,\"name\":\"Sirena Irwin\",\"character\":\"Beverly\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uWP0DF9hOy1G8rMEDS1qLguwOEr.jpg\"},{\"id\":19578,\"name\":\"Alexis Arquette\",\"character\":\"Michael\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jNRBwGKXOZFWLI2ceff1sMUdxcE.jpg\"},{\"id\":41256,\"name\":\"Art Hindle\",\"character\":\"Ted Oakley\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lhoh2KGtDfSjiIJSKT9ymTypPCf.jpg\"},{\"id\":40680,\"name\":\"Julie Brown\",\"character\":\"OutLoud Receptionist\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hdTnxS4ry9eDaCZVcItiZ9MEJKk.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":27,\"title\":\"9 Songs\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/91O7z0vo7MiNWd5xD2BoivwbQsb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bybAHw5fenKXRFI4phanPhpljlT.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Matt, a young glaciologist, soars across the vast, silent, icebound immensities of the South Pole as he recalls his love affair with Lisa. They meet at a mobbed rock concert in a vast music hall - London's Brixton Academy. They are in bed at night's end. Together, over a period of several months, they pursue a mutual sexual passion whose inevitable stages unfold in counterpoint to nine live-concert songs.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1503762,\"title\":\"Sense and Sensibility\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/czsyPHosFNbh4PPqXfqWu1aBXnA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tIcONOFK9D3F89ETK8DBS1hIwVF.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A charming, witty, and deeply relatable story of love and sisterhood.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":290098,\"title\":\"The Handmaiden\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dLlH4aNHdnmf62umnInL8xPlPzw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2b3RNXF7ca9bgX8FrjRBYfLnNQC.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"1930s Korea, in the period of Japanese occupation, a new girl, Sook-hee, is hired as a handmaiden to a Japanese heiress, Hideko, who lives a secluded life on a large countryside estate with her domineering Uncle Kouzuki. But the maid has a secret. She is a pickpocket recruited by a swindler posing as a Japanese Count to help him seduce the Lady to steal her fortune.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":453,\"title\":\"A Beautiful Mind\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rEIg5yJdNOt9fmX4P8gU9LeNoTQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hCJFWTPghXCwwSpvPpAoIB8318Q.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"From the heights of notoriety to the depths of depravity, John Forbes Nash Jr. experiences it all. As a brilliant but socially awkward mathematician, he made a groundbreaking discovery early in his career and stands on the brink of international acclaim. But as the handsome and arrogant Nash accepts secret work in cryptography, he becomes entangled in a mysterious conspiracy. His life takes a nightmarish turn and he soon finds himself on a painful and harrowing journey of self-discovery.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8966,\"title\":\"Twilight\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3Gkb6jm6962ADUPaCBqzz9CTbn9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/weAYfu6FfrNxEDJ3xH1XpgQcqUv.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Bella Swan moves to a small town in the Pacific Northwest, she falls in love with Edward Cullen, a mysterious classmate who reveals himself to be a 108-year-old vampire. Despite Edward's repeated cautions, Bella can't stay away from him, a fatal move that endangers her own life.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1516698,\"title\":\"The Last Sunrise\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3PWJqDfygN0YNNjWsDUOXclCp3h.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zFCWfU2ViMIm38G1W8UsnSpqmWn.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ry, a college student with a chronic illness, escapes to Mallorca for the summer with her mother, where she unexpectedly falls for a local and begins to embrace living in the moment. But as her condition worsens and long-hidden family secrets come to light, everything she has found before summer's end is threatened.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11036,\"title\":\"The Notebook\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rNzQyW4f8B8cQeg7Dgj3n6eT5k9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zdXnJqBaGFVtLoPNuMeKfEYUViZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An epic love story centered around an older man who reads aloud to a woman with Alzheimer's. From a faded notebook, the old man's words bring to life the story about a couple who is separated by World War II, and is then passionately reunited, seven years later, after they have taken different paths.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":48650,\"title\":\"Room in Rome\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w90ItYf9qagQKVEBr1uFxPomAtf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/abQxLSkGxpHyUxRjRXACt8NbiGf.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A hotel room in the center of Rome serves as the setting for Alba and Natasha, two sexy and recently acquainted women, to have a physical adventure that touches their very souls.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1381078,\"title\":\"Love of Your Life\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dL3Tcv4FU2K85bgnGRBgLjFSrLr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4hneB0UFKOZAGJHqJ3VhDcG72uH.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a chance encounter sparks a sweeping romance, Maya's future is suddenly upended, sending her on an unexpected journey to love and live again.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1010581,\"title\":\"My Fault\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w46Vw536HwNnEzOa7J24YH9DPRS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oz4U9eA6ilYf1tyiVuGmkftdLac.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Noah must leave her city, boyfriend, and friends to move into William Leister's mansion, the flashy and wealthy husband of her mother Rafaela. As a proud and independent 17 year old, Noah resists living in a mansion surrounded by luxury. However, it is there where she meets Nick, her new stepbrother, and the clash of their strong personalities becomes evident from the very beginning.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":313369,\"title\":\"La La Land\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uDO8zWDhfWwoFdKS4fzkUJt0Rf0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nlPCdZlHtRNcF6C9hzUH4ebmV1w.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Mia, an aspiring actress, serves lattes to movie stars in between auditions and Sebastian, a jazz musician, scrapes by playing cocktail party gigs in dingy bars, but as success mounts they are faced with decisions that begin to fray the fragile fabric of their love affair, and the dreams they worked so hard to maintain in each other threaten to rip them apart.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":216015,\"title\":\"Fifty Shades of Grey\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/63kGofUkt1Mx0SIL4XI4Z5AoSgt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7IGKrY1f1KfwMipx9wZC4NRgIdF.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When college senior Anastasia Steele steps in for her sick roommate to interview prominent businessman Christian Grey for their campus paper, little does she realize the path her life will take. Christian, as enigmatic as he is rich and powerful, finds himself strangely drawn to Ana, and she to him. Though sexually inexperienced, Ana plunges headlong into an affair -- and learns that Christian's true sexual proclivities push the boundaries of pain and pleasure.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"7nKExyTX3HI\",\"name\":\"The Trip Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":"